    "386": {
      "date": "2026-11-24",
      "edition": "Tuesday 24 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Press verdict",
          "heading": "Guardian's Robert Kitson hails England's champagne rugby after 37-12 All Blacks win",
          "body": "Kitson's Guardian verdict credited England and Ireland with the northern hemisphere's champagne rugby in the round that tees up finals weekend, and Saturday's 37-12 win over New Zealand was England's contribution. Ben Earl was man of the match in a five-try display that brought a fifth consecutive Test victory and back-to-back wins over the All Blacks for the first time since 2002 and 2003. Of the 46 fans in the app who answered, 96% were buzzing at the result."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Ireland beat Springboks 20-17 to set up Australia finals clash",
