      }
    },
    "387": {
      "date": "2026-11-24",
      "edition": "Tuesday 24 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Full-back return",
          "heading": "Thomas Ramos recalled to France squad for Nations Championship final against Springboks",
          "body": "Fabien Galthié has brought the Toulouse full-back back into his 42-man group after two months out with a thigh muscle injury and a relapse. Rugbyrama expects France's record points scorer to go straight into the starting XV at Twickenham, as Matthieu Jalibert did after a similar setback. That would return Théo Attissogbe, shifted to 15 in Ramos's absence, to the wing opposite Bielle-Biarrey, restoring the back three from the last Six Nations. It also adds a leading voice, with Grégory Alldritt forced out of the squad."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Ireland beat Springboks 20-17 to set up Australia finals clash",
          "body": "Argentina lose 45-17 to France after Mayco Vivas red card."
